# 🚀 claudebackup linux Beta v1.0 Guide

> 💿 **"Create Bootable ISO Images from Your System"**

---

## 🔧 Quick Start Guide

### 1️⃣ Build and Run

```bash
git clone https://github.com/claudemods/claudebackup-linux.git
cd claudebackup-linux/dev-release
make                       # compile the program
sudo make install          # optional: install to /usr/bin
claudebackup-linux         # start the menu (asks for sudo once)
```

📦 You need `g++` and `make`. Everything else the build needs is installed from inside the app (step 1 below).

---

