## 🐧 Supported Distributions

| Family | Distros |
|--------|---------|
| **Debian** | Debian, Ubuntu, Mint, Pop, Kali, Devuan, openKylin |
| **Arch** | Arch, CachyOS, Archcraft, RebornOS, Garuda, EndeavourOS |
| **Manjaro** | Manjaro, BigLinux, BigCommunity |
| **Fedora** | Fedora, Nobara |
| **openSUSE** | Tumbleweed, Slowroll, Leap |
| **Alpine** | Alpine |

The family is detected from `/etc/os-release` (`ID` and `ID_LIKE`).

